  m_Text: 'Case: If git call fails, you can download and use the package directly.

    1.
    Open a web browser and enter the url below.

    Then connect to''UnityChanSpringBone''
    git.



    2. Download the code. And unzip it.

    3. Go back to the package
    manager and select''add package from disk...''.

    4. Go to the folder path
    in #2, select package.json and open it. This will start the installation.

    5.
    Please reopen the scene after installation!'
